{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18285","headline":"奉酬天平马十二仆射暇日言怀见寄之作 · 韩愈","name":"奉酬天平马十二仆射暇日言怀见寄之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天平篇什外，政事亦无双。\n威令加徐土，儒风被鲁邦。\n清爲公论重，宽得士心降。\n岁晏偏相忆，长谣坐北窗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18285.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18285","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}